'' MANY PUBLIC NAMES, AND TYPES NESTED IN TYPES, THROUGH AN IMPORT. ModSym.Mark and
'' MarkImported put a declaration's 'public' / 'private' on its symbols by scanning the whole
'' table once per declaration, and UdtLayouts.Find scanned every layout once per field: a cold
'' build of tracks-2026, whose units import sys/win, took 755 s (TB-011). Both are one pass
'' now. 4,096 macro-made public consts, an enum's constants in both of its scopes, a
'' 'public declare' overload set over plain definitions, and four levels of embedded types
'' (sizes and offsets measured with fbc-modern) must come through unchanged.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i tests/modules/src/markscale/libs tests/modules/src/markscale/main.bas -o tests/modules/markscale.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/markscale.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  3 5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  42 5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  8 20 44 92
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  48 20
